  <jpcrp_cor:PurposeOfShareholdingOverviewOfBusinessAllianceQuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingAndReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesDetailsOfDeemedHoldingsOfSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row3Member">議決権行使の指図</jpcrp_cor:PurposeOfShareholdingOverviewOfBusinessAllianceQuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingAndReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesDetailsOfDeemedHoldingsOfSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
  <jpcrp_cor:WhetherIssuerOfAforementionedSharesHoldsReportingCompanysSharesDetailsOfDeemedHoldingsOfSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row3Member">有</jpcrp_cor:WhetherIssuerOfAforementionedSharesHoldsReportingCompanysSharesDetailsOfDeemedHoldingsOfSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
  <jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesDetailsOfDeemedHoldingsOfEquitySecuritiesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row4Member">宝ホールディングス株式会社</jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesDetailsOfDeemedHoldingsOfEquitySecuritiesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
  <jpcrp_cor:PurposeOfShareholdingOverviewOfBusinessAllianceQuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingAndReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesDetailsOfDeemedHoldingsOfSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row4Member">議決権行使の指図</jpcrp_cor:PurposeOfShareholdingOverviewOfBusinessAllianceQuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingAndReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesDetailsOfDeemedHoldingsOfSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
